  "description": "Failed horror writer Gong Chan-Hyuk’s BL webtoons are wildly popular—but he hates writing them. Then superstar Lee Hyeok-Su, his secret crush, shows up to pitch a drama adaptation. When an old tablet with steamy fanfic about Hyeok-Su falls out of Chan-Hyuk’s closet, things get… complicated. Hyeok-Su suggests they reenact the story—and their “casual” affair begins. But when Chan-Hyuk overhears a suspicious conversation, everything threatens to unravel.\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
